From wraff at titus.u-strasbg.fr  Thu Oct 30 16:33:09 2008
From: wraff at titus.u-strasbg.fr (Wolfgang Raffelsberger)
Date: Thu, 30 Oct 2008 16:33:09 +0100
Subject: [Bioc-sig-seq] SNP counting (Biostrings ?) question
In-Reply-To: <490220D9.1070005@fhcrc.org>
